# kind: compression-header
# description: LZC header whose byte 7 has the unused bits 0x20 and 0x40 set: they are ignored, and maxbits is 13.
# derivation: 256 as u32 LE (PV-0061, PV-0062); 0x11 = LZC (PV-0065, PV-0066); magic (PV-0067); byte 7 = 0xED = 0x80 | 0x40 | 0x20 | 0x0D: maxbits = 0xED & 0x1F = 13 (PV-0310, PV-0311), block_mode 1 (PV-0312), unused bits 0x60 ignored (PV-0313, IMPL-CH-9); reading R-CH-5.
# expect.error: none
# expect.uncompressed_length: 256
# expect.algorithm: lzc
# expect.version: 1
# expect.maxbits: 13
# expect.block_mode: 1
# expect.unused_bits: 0x60
hex:
00 01 00 00                                       # uncompressed length, u32 LE
11                                                # algorithm byte
1F 9D                                             # magic
ED                                                # byte 7
